<view class="page cart-page"><view class="top"><view class="section-title">🛒 闪电小餐车</view><view class="muted">每一份都是给你的偏爱</view></view><view wx:if="{{lines.length===0}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-icon">🍽️</text>餐车还空空的，先去挑点好吃的吧<button class="btn" bindtap="backMenu">去看菜单</button></view><block wx:else><view class="items cream-card"><view wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="id" class="line"><image src="{{item.item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="line-main"><view class="line-name">{{item.item.name}}</view><view class="muted line-type">{{item.item.type==='special_service'?'💗 甜蜜专属':'⚡ 主厨手作'}}</view><view class="line-price">⚡ {{item.subtotal}}</view></view><view class="line-actions"><view class="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</view><view class="counter"><text data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="decrease">−</text><text>{{item.qty}}</text><text data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="increase">+</text></view></view></view></view><view class="prefs cream-card"><view class="section-title">口味小纸条 📝</view><view class="label">辣度偏好</view><radio-group bindchange="tasteChange" class="radios"><label><radio value="不辣" checked="{{taste==='不辣'}}" color="#f5b72e"/>不辣</label><label><radio value="微辣" checked="{{taste==='微辣'}}" color="#f5b72e"/>微辣</label><label><radio value="中辣" checked="{{taste==='中辣'}}" color="#f5b72e"/>中辣</label><label><radio value="特辣" checked="{{taste==='特辣'}}" color="#f5b72e"/>特辣</label></radio-group><view class="label">还有什么想告诉主厨？</view><textarea placeholder="例如：少盐、不要香菜、想要一个抱抱…" maxlength="200" value="{{note}}" bindinput="noteChange"/></view><view class="hint">⚡ 闪电币只是趣味计数，不涉及真实支付。</view></block><view class="sticky-actions"><view class="checkout"><view><view class="sum">合计 ⚡ {{total}}</view><view class="muted">共 {{count}} 份</view></view><button class="btn" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{lines.length===0}}">确认下单 →</button></view></view></view>
